# Error contract

## Shape (`packages/api`)

`ApiErrorPayload`: `code`, optional `message`, `params`, `details`, `traceId`

- `code` — stable i18n key (prefer `I18nKey`)
- FE translates `code` (+ `params`) via message catalogs
- **Never** expose stack traces or Prisma/SQL text to clients

## BE

- Use Nest `HttpException` with key or filter mapping — see `apps/api/src/common/filters/`
- Map status → default `I18nKey` when needed

## FE

- Parse error JSON; display via `t(code)` or equivalent
- Do not show raw `message` from server if it duplicates internal errors

Detail: [docs/04-error-handling.md](../docs/04-error-handling.md)
